# Inflected forms the heuristic in tools/demote_ja_conjugations.py cannot reach, merged into
# ja.demoted on every regeneration. Format: reading<TAB>surface (the same key the converter uses).
#
# Nearly all of these are Mozc READING errors rather than gaps in the paradigm logic. The detector
# links a form to its paradigm through the stem it shares with its own reading, so a form filed
# under the WRONG reading has no siblings to be recognised by: 高そう is the 〜そう form of the
# adjective 高い (たかい), but Mozc files it under こうそう, where the stem is (こう, 高) and
# nothing connects it to 高い/たかい. Same for 轢こう under びこう (the verb is 轢く/ひく).
#
# Each line names what should lead the reading instead.

# --- Mozc reading errors: adjective 〜そう filed under the kanji's ON reading
こうそう	高そう	# 構想 / 高層 / 抗争 — 高そう belongs under たかそう
じゅうそう	重そう	# 重曹 / 十三 — 重そう belongs under おもそう
けいそう	軽そう	# 計装 / 珪藻 — 軽そう belongs under かるそう

# --- Mozc reading error: verb volitional filed under a voiced reading
びこう	轢こう	# 備考 / 尾行 / 鼻腔 — the verb is 轢く (ひく)

# --- カ変 (来る): an irregular paradigm whose reading changes with the slot (こ/き/く), so the
#     sibling-slot detector cannot assemble it. The fragments below are never standalone words.
こよう	来よう	# 雇用
きたそ	来たそ
きたし	来たし
きたせ	来たせ
きたら	来たら
きたっ	来たっ

# --- verbs absent from the table entirely, so their forms have no paradigm to be found in
そこう	措こう	# 素行 — 措く itself is not in ja_readings.txt
